$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{10})=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10}).\n$$\n\nRewriting the given expression using the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10}) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})}} \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-65609/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5f9683d9-05b9-5a42-9f81-0170a15dfac1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65609"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120024/selection/ba4f93c665eeb1d3119190b9d55cefe3cc9a2e4ac6c6f214e083029332e7ade6" :answer/id #uuid "b579223d-8d16-53c6-9211-cd05c4c8fd36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120024/selection/a3de6f59e0f834ace8f458253cc2e7fb7f236546a40e7ea8cc4c787ebf0178f8" :answer/id #uuid "6a05b73c-5266-524e-942d-aa4fdaa77be4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120024/selection/19f864016564c08ff6d4213f657a2c8a4972c88027e264971bf05c1a6c86ec1d" :answer/id #uuid "72b7fefd-5832-5a10-88fe-941167df7f6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120024/selection/46007f6415e3526b4dcecd86f71e430a26e289b37399831444d48bff3d6e66ec" :a