, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{10})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5}).\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5}) & =3\\cdot [2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})]\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5}) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-76664/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d820aa9f-7c02-53b5-9b09-c25ee59dbdaf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76664"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-327716/field-1/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer/id #uuid "41c89a54-fb37-5e7f-b93d-ebbdffe60694" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-327716/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "75fef84a-4659-5182-9dc8-65882bb13b73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-327716/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0b960d8-b823-521f-ba0a-f080d7d65c62" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-327716/field-1/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer-field/choices ["q-327716/field-1/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" "q-327716/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-327716" :question/id #uuid "62770764-8176-56e9-8c60-1a1dcb94a9d1" :question/math-academy-id "q-327716" :question/problem "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{24}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24})\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})} & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the double-angle formula once more with $x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}$, we can further simplify the above expression: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-327716/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d820aa9f-7c02-53b5-9b09-c25ee59dbdaf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-327716"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-364640/field-1/929f0fe8ee4e83df6368c7c1ffbbd3c555b08820b5c5a21d9349bc7befb88a32" :answer/id #uuid "12a3cbfb-4b25-5278-a653-b36ffcef4db7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-364640/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b189a8a4-4669-5bff-b037-1f9fc969ab66" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-364640/field-1/929f0fe8ee4e83df6368c7c1ffbbd3c555b08820b5c5a21d9349bc7befb88a32" :answer-field/choices ["q-364640/field-1/929f0fe8ee4e83df6368c7c1ffbbd3c555b08820b5c5a21d9349bc7befb88a32"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-364640" :question/id #uuid "6aab47f3-0a6d-55dd-bbdd-19d0314c54b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-364640" :question/problem "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{12})\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})} & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the double-angle formula once more with $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}$, we can further simplify the above expression: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-364640/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d820aa9f-7c02-53b5-9b09-c25ee59dbdaf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-364640"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-364639/field-1/602764c7df5493d96a41df7b1e43f6b176fc7746e6dea7e7edcd879542478102" :answer/id #uuid "bed365c5-0288-5a0b-af12-adb975de962b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-364639/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "dfc2e1ef-318e-5dbb-b289-b4c8ac01a20b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-364639/field-1/602764c7df5493d96a41df7b1e43f6b176fc7746e6dea7e7edcd879542478102" :answer-field/choices ["q-364639/field-1/602764c7df5493d96a41df7b1e43f6b176fc7746e6dea7e7edcd879542478102"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-364639" :question/id #uuid "d196384f-4e56-525b-b52f-9a047afd0095" :question/math-academy-id "q-364639" :question/problem "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{16}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{16})\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})} & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the double-angle formula once more with $x=\\frac{\\pi }{8}$, we can further simplify the above expression: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-364639/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d820aa9f-7c02-53b5-9b09-c25ee59dbdaf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-364639"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
